  "description": "You may encounter rough weather while pulling the cargo, so this epithelial truck tonneau which covers the back of the pickup truck will provide total cargo protection. When you pass a bumpy road, it helps to keep cargo inside the truck and prevents items dropping from your vehicle while delivering. The truck tonneau cover will shield your cargo from the heavy rain and strong wind when you are pulling the cargo. This is no doubt an item safety enforcer for you.\nFitment\nfor 2015-2026 Chevy / Chevrolet Colorado 5.2 ft\nfor 2015-2026 GMC Canyon 5.2 ft\nFeatures\nPrecise Fit: The soft tri-fold tonneau cover is compatible with the 5.2' bed of 2015 2016 2017 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 Chevrolet Colorado & GMC Canyon\nUnique Clamp Design: Features two clamp types, as the rear clamp is designed with a new release bolt to effectively prevent springing with strong sealing during driving; the Safety buckle connects with an aluminum safety rope that’s light and will not easily deform\nEasy to Install & Use: No-drilling installation is a breeze with instructions and mounting hardware included; Simply fold the cover back for convenient cargo removal\nAll-around Protection: The soft tri-fold tonneau cover is built using reinforced UV & cold-resistant PVC materials that aptly guard your cargo against rain, snow, and other harsh weather conditions\nCargo Storage Securing: Added security for your truck bed contents, deterring theft and protecting items.",
